{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/d953d606594eb8cb8c3f8403c897da72.avif?t=1769509961\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras_big/d953d606594eb8cb8c3f8403c897da72.avif?t=1769509961 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enrich your life with real-life knowledge of plants, recipes, herbalism and more!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of nature to rebuild your home in Out and About, a cozy foraging adventure! A storm has blown through the town of Portobello. To help this little community get back on its feet, you\u2019ll need to learn all about the wild surrounding landscape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn to identify 57 real life plants and fungi\u00a0</strong>- knowledge that carries over into real life! Forage for food, cook supplies, and form deep friendships with the town's residents, who are slowly coming together as a community striving for sustainability. <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/f3ee26a9234463e7c5428b9c48eb3f51.poster.avif?t=1769509961\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/f3ee26a9234463e7c5428b9c48eb3f51.webm?t=1769509961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/f3ee26a9234463e7c5428b9c48eb3f51.mp4?t=1769509961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook delicious recipes and brew herbal remedies</strong> to help the townsfolk. Al